WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.400 line:78%
Welcome back, Architect.

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:04.687 line:78%
Today, you completed something that very few people ever choose to do.

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:06.771 line:78%
You chose to intentionally create your life.

00:00:06.821 --> 00:00:10.658 line:78%
Over the past seven chapters, you've awakened. You've looked honestly at your life.

00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:13.621 line:78%
You've made courageous decisions. You've established standards.

00:00:13.671 --> 00:00:15.752 line:78%
You've embraced the identity of an Architect.

00:00:15.802 --> 00:00:19.408 line:78%
And you've committed to creating a life of fullness, purpose, and possibility.

00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:23.388 line:78%
That deserves to be celebrated. But I also want to remind you of something
important.

00:00:23.438 --> 00:00:25.843 line:78%
This is not the finish line. It's the starting line.

00:00:25.893 --> 00:00:28.343 line:78%
The Back Half was never about completing a guidebook.

00:00:28.393 --> 00:00:32.185 line:78%
It was about becoming the kind of person who lives intentionally every single day.

00:00:32.235 --> 00:00:34.870 line:78%
Some days that will feel effortless. Other days it won't.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:38.850 line:78%
On those days, return to what you've created here. Return to your Decision
Statement.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.506 line:78%
Return to your Standards. Return to your Identity. Return to your Declaration.

00:00:42.556 --> 00:00:44.082 line:78%
Remember who you chose to become.

00:00:44.132 --> 00:00:48.386 line:78%
I hope this Journey has reminded you of something that may have been buried for a
long time.

00:00:48.436 --> 00:00:50.655 line:78%
Your life still holds extraordinary possibility.

00:00:50.705 --> 00:00:54.728 line:78%
Your greatest chapters are not behind you. They're waiting to be intentionally
created.

00:00:54.778 --> 00:00:58.523 line:78%
Thank you for trusting me to be part of your Journey. It has truly been an honor.

00:00:58.573 --> 00:01:01.856 line:78%
Congratulations, Architect. Now go create a life that reminds others...

00:01:01.906 --> 00:01:02.706 line:78%
Magical is Possible.
